---
description: "Jest testing conventions for Nest (*.spec.ts) and Lambda (*.test.ts)."
globs:
  - "**/*.spec.ts"
  - "**/*.test.ts"
  - "jest.config.js"
  - "lambda/jest.config.js"
  - "test/**/*"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Testing Rules

- Maintain 80% coverage thresholds (root + lambda)
- Nest: co-locate `*.spec.ts`; Lambda: co-locate `*.test.ts`
- Mock AWS SDK, Anthropic, TypeORM, and network I/O
- Test ECDSA guard edges including prod bypass impossibility
- Do not overtest empty Nest module boilerplate
- Prefer regression tests for bug fixes

## Commands

```bash
make test
make test-cov
make lambda-test
```
